{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-debugging-workflow","title":"性能调试工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/analysis/performance-debugging-workflow","wordCount":892,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能调试工作流\">性能调试工作流</h1><p>RUM 仪表板告诉你 INP P75 是 380ms，但这只是症状。真正有价值的是从聚合指标出发，逐步缩小范围，最终定位到具体代码行的系统化调试工作流。这个过程遵循&quot;Field 定位 → Lab 复现 → Attribution 归因 → Fix 修复 → Verify 验证&quot;的闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>性能调试不是随机浏览 DevTools，而是一个有纪律的收敛过程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Step 1: 识别失败指标&lt;br/&gt;CrUX / RUM Dashboard] --&gt; B[Step 2: 分段定位&lt;br/&gt;URL/设备/网络/地理]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Step 3: 归因数据&lt;br/&gt;web-vitals attribution]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Step 4: Lab 复现&lt;br/&gt;DevTools Performance]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Step 5: 根因定位&lt;br/&gt;LoAF / Call Tree / Network]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Step 6: 修复]&#10;    F --&gt; G[Step 7: 验证&lt;br/&gt;Local → Staging → CrUX]&#10;    G --&gt;|未改善| B\">graph TD\n    A[Step 1: 识别失败指标&lt;br/&gt;CrUX / RUM Dashboard] --&gt; B[Step 2: 分段定位&lt;br/&gt;URL/设备/网络/地理]\n    B --&gt; C[Step 3: 归因数据&lt;br/&gt;web-vitals attribution]\n    C --&gt; D[Step 4: Lab 复现&lt;br/&gt;DevTools Performance]\n    D --&gt; E[Step 5: 根因定位&lt;br/&gt;LoAF / Call Tree / Network]\n    E --&gt; F[Step 6: 修复]\n    F --&gt; G[Step 7: 验证&lt;br/&gt;Local → Staging → CrUX]\n    G --&gt;|未改善| B</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调试阶段</th>\n<th>使用工具</th>\n<th>产出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>识别问题</td>\n<td>CrUX / RUM Dashboard</td>\n<td>哪个指标、哪类页面失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分段定位</td>\n<td>RUM 数据按维度切片</td>\n<td>具体 URL + 设备/网络组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归因</td>\n<td>web-vitals attribution / LoAF</td>\n<td>问题元素 + 三阶段耗时拆解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复现</td>\n<td>DevTools Performance + 4x CPU 降速</td>\n<td>Flame Chart 中的长任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>根因</td>\n<td>Call Tree + Bottom-Up + Source Map</td>\n<td>具体函数和代码行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证</td>\n<td>Lighthouse CI + RUM 趋势</td>\n<td>指标改善确认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"step-1-2-从聚合到分段\">Step 1-2: 从聚合到分段</h2><p>当 RUM 告警触发&quot;INP P75 &gt; 200ms&quot;，第一步不是打开 DevTools，而是在 RUM 数据中按维度切片：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 假设使用自建 RUM 后端，SQL 分段查询示例&#10;// 按页面模板分段&#10;SELECT page_template, percentile_cont(0.75) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY inp_value) as p75_inp&#10;FROM vitals WHERE metric = &#39;INP&#39; AND date &gt; now() - interval &#39;7 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY page_template ORDER BY p75_inp DESC;&#10;&#10;// 按设备类型分段&#10;SELECT device_category, percentile_cont(0.75) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY inp_value) as p75_inp&#10;FROM vitals WHERE metric = &#39;INP&#39; AND page_template = &#39;product-detail&#39;&#10;GROUP BY device_category;&#10;&#10;// 按交互类型分段（需 attribution 数据）&#10;SELECT interaction_target, interaction_type,&#10;       percentile_cont(0.75) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY inp_value) as p75_inp,&#10;       count(*) as sample_count&#10;FROM vitals_attribution WHERE metric = &#39;INP&#39;&#10;GROUP BY interaction_target, interaction_type&#10;HAVING count(*) &gt; 100&#10;ORDER BY p75_inp DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 假设使用自建 RUM 后端，SQL 分段查询示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 按页面模板分段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page_template, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ORDER</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inp_value) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> p75_inp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vitals </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metric </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'INP'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page_template </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ORDER</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p75_inp </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 按设备类型分段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device_category, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ORDER</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inp_value) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> p75_inp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vitals </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metric </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'INP'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page_template </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'product-detail'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device_category;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 按交互类型分段（需 attribution 数据）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interaction_target, interaction_type,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">       percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ORDER</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inp_value) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> p75_inp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sample_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vitals_attribution </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metric </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'INP'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interaction_target, interaction_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ORDER</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p75_inp </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>典型发现模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>&quot;INP 主要来自 product-detail 页面的 mobile 设备&quot;</li>\n<li>&quot;具体交互是 <code>button.add-to-cart</code> 的 click 事件&quot;</li>\n<li>&quot;三阶段中 Processing Time 占 72%&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"step-3-attribution-数据深度归因\">Step 3: Attribution 数据深度归因</h2><p>web-vitals 的 attribution build 和 Long Animation Frames API 提供了从指标到代码的桥梁：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { onINP } from &#39;web-vitals/attribution&#39;;&#10;&#10;onINP((metric) =&gt; {&#10;  if (metric.value &gt; 200) {&#10;    const { attribution } = metric;&#10;&#10;    // 三阶段耗时拆解&#10;    const breakdown = {&#10;      inputDelay: attribution.inputDelay,&#10;      processingDuration: attribution.processingDuration,&#10;      presentationDelay: attribution.presentationDelay,&#10;      target: attribution.interactionTarget,&#10;      type: attribution.interactionType,&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    // LoAF 脚本级归因&#10;    const scripts = attribution.longAnimationFrameEntries?.flatMap(&#10;      (loaf: any) =&gt;&#10;        loaf.scripts?.map((s: any) =&gt; ({&#10;          source: s.sourceURL,&#10;          function: s.sourceFunctionName,&#10;          duration: s.duration,&#10;          invoker: s.invoker,&#10;        })) ?? [],&#10;    );&#10;&#10;    reportDebugData({ breakdown, scripts, value: metric.value });&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { onINP } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'web-vitals/attribution'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onINP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (metric.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">attribution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metric;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 三阶段耗时拆解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> breakdown</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      inputDelay: attribution.inputDelay,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      processingDuration: attribution.processingDuration,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      presentationDelay: attribution.presentationDelay,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      target: attribution.interactionTarget,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: attribution.interactionType,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // LoAF 脚本级归因</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> scripts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attribution.longAnimationFrameEntries?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flatMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">loaf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        loaf.scripts?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          source: s.sourceURL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          function: s.sourceFunctionName,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          duration: s.duration,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          invoker: s.invoker,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        })) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    reportDebugData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ breakdown, scripts, value: metric.value });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>归因数据直接回答：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Input Delay 高</strong>：主线程在交互发生时被其他任务阻塞 → 找出当时在跑什么</li>\n<li><strong>Processing Time 高</strong>：事件处理函数本身太慢 → 优化处理逻辑</li>\n<li><strong>Presentation Delay 高</strong>：处理完但渲染慢 → 检查 DOM 规模 / 强制布局</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"step-4-5-devtools-performance-复现\">Step 4-5: DevTools Performance 复现</h2><p>拿到 attribution 数据后，在 DevTools 中精确复现：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>打开 DevTools → Performance 面板</li>\n<li>启用 <strong>CPU 4x slowdown</strong>（模拟中低端移动设备）</li>\n<li>开始录制 → 执行目标交互 → 停止录制</li>\n<li>在 Flame Chart 中定位该交互对应的事件处理</li>\n</ol>\n<p>关键分析路径：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分析视图</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Main Thread</td>\n<td>整体时间线</td>\n<td>红色三角标记的 Long Task</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Event Log</td>\n<td>事件明细</td>\n<td>目标交互的 duration</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Call Tree</td>\n<td>函数调用树</td>\n<td>Self Time 最高的函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bottom-Up</td>\n<td>反向聚合</td>\n<td>跨多帧的热点函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Network</td>\n<td>资源加载</td>\n<td>阻塞渲染的请求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Flame Chart&lt;br/&gt;定位长任务] --&gt; B[Call Tree&lt;br/&gt;找到耗时函数]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Source Map&lt;br/&gt;映射到源码]&#10;    C --&gt; D[代码审查&lt;br/&gt;确认根因]&#10;    D --&gt; E[修复策略&lt;br/&gt;拆分/延迟/Worker]\">graph LR\n    A[Flame Chart&lt;br/&gt;定位长任务] --&gt; B[Call Tree&lt;br/&gt;找到耗时函数]\n    B --&gt; C[Source Map&lt;br/&gt;映射到源码]\n    C --&gt; D[代码审查&lt;br/&gt;确认根因]\n    D --&gt; E[修复策略&lt;br/&gt;拆分/延迟/Worker]</pre><h2 id=\"常见根因与修复模式\">常见根因与修复模式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>根因类别</th>\n<th>诊断信号</th>\n<th>修复策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第三方脚本阻塞</td>\n<td>LoAF 显示非业务域名的脚本</td>\n<td><code>requestIdleCallback</code> 延迟加载 / Facade 模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>React 水合风暴</td>\n<td>Processing Time 高 + 首次交互</td>\n<td>渐进式水合 / React Server Components</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Layout Thrashing</td>\n<td>频繁 offsetHeight 后改 style</td>\n<td>批量读写分离 / <code>requestAnimationFrame</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超大 DOM 重新计算</td>\n<td>Presentation Delay 高</td>\n<td>虚拟列表 / content-visibility: auto</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步计算密集型逻辑</td>\n<td>单个函数 Self Time &gt; 50ms</td>\n<td>Web Worker 卸载 / 分片执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字体加载 FOUT</td>\n<td>CLS 在 loadState=loading 时发生</td>\n<td><code>font-display: optional</code> + preload</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"step-6-7-修复验证闭环\">Step 6-7: 修复验证闭环</h2><p>修复后的验证必须经过三层：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 1. Local: Lighthouse CI 本地验证&#10;// lighthouse --budget-path=budget.json --output=json&#10;&#10;// 2. Staging: 部署到预发环境，用 Puppeteer 模拟交互&#10;// 检查 INP-approximation（TBT 变化）&#10;&#10;// 3. Production: 部署后监控 RUM 数据趋势&#10;// 等待 2-3 天确认 P75 改善&#10;// CrUX 需要 28 天完整滚动后才能反映\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1. Local: Lighthouse CI 本地验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// lighthouse --budget-path=budget.json --output=json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2. Staging: 部署到预发环境，用 Puppeteer 模拟交互</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 检查 INP-approximation（TBT 变化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3. Production: 部署后监控 RUM 数据趋势</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 等待 2-3 天确认 P75 改善</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// CrUX 需要 28 天完整滚动后才能反映</span></span></code></pre></div><p>验证的时间维度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>即时</strong>：Lighthouse CI 在 PR 中对比基线</li>\n<li><strong>短期</strong>（1-3 天）：RUM 数据 P75 趋势确认</li>\n<li><strong>长期</strong>（4 周）：CrUX 数据正式反映，SEO 影响可观测</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>性能调试遵循 Field→分段→归因→复现→根因→修复→验证 的收敛流程</li>\n<li>分段定位是关键步骤——不要在聚合数据上猜测，按 URL/设备/交互切片</li>\n<li>web-vitals attribution + LoAF 提供从指标到脚本函数的归因链路</li>\n<li>DevTools Performance 用 4x CPU 降速复现中低端设备体验</li>\n<li>验证必须三层：Local Lighthouse → RUM 趋势 → CrUX 最终确认</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"crux-field-data\">CrUX 真实用户数据解读</a>——调试工作流中 Field Data 的获取和分析方法</li>\n<li><a href=\"../frontend-web-workers-parallelism/foundations/main-thread-blocking\">Web Workers 与并行计算 — 主线程阻塞</a>——理解长任务阻塞的底层原因及 Worker 卸载方案</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能调试工作流","id":"性能调试工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Step 1-2: 从聚合到分段","id":"step-1-2-从聚合到分段"},{"level":2,"text":"Step 3: Attribution 数据深度归因","id":"step-3-attribution-数据深度归因"},{"level":2,"text":"Step 4-5: DevTools Performance 复现","id":"step-4-5-devtools-performance-复现"},{"level":2,"text":"常见根因与修复模式","id":"常见根因与修复模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Step 6-7: 修复验证闭环","id":"step-6-7-修复验证闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"RUM 平台选型与对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/analysis/rum-platforms"},"next":{"title":"性能预算与 CI 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/operations/performance-budgets-ci"}}